ain of the Watch knocks for his dues: nine per city, each bigger than the last. Pay early and it costs less. Come up short and he carries you once per city, for 25% on top. Every 100 gold you pay earns a legacy point.When you can't pay, or when","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:44:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4452620-1839041357026321","game_id":"steam-4452620","kind":"announcement","title":"Town Rebuilt, Guided First Heist, and a New Mimic Encounter","summary":"Town Rebuilt, Guided First Heist, and a New Mimic Encounter Hi everyone, The biggest update to the Thieves & Gold demo is now live. The Town has been rebuilt, the opening heist is now guided by the characters themselves, a new Mimic encounter has been added, and the complete demo is now available in German. This update also includes major improvements to bombs, hammer targeting, challenges, run results, the Skill Tree, room fairness, and overall readability. Town and Crew Rebuilt Town interface ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T10:35:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357026321","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4452620-1832700592786085","game_id":"steam-4452620","kind":"announcement","title":"Hover Polish, Skill Tree Previews & Big Balance Pass","summary":"New FeaturesAlways-visible hover screen dot - Cleaner targeting indicator that's always on screen, with improved container selection behavior.Skill Tree room previews - Tooltips on the skill tree now show a preview image of the room, along with progress indicators and loot value info.Coin Cache artifact - New artifact with its own effect logic.Vault Breaker Mastery upgrade - New meta-upgrade for progression.Exhausted relic callout - Players are now notified when a relic has been exhausted. Polis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T11:50:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4452620-1831432155579742","game_id":"steam-4452620","kind":"announcement","title":"macOS version + retroactive Relic points","summary":"Demo update - now playable on macOS! Relic card points are now granted retroactively when unlocked, plus a sweep of performance improvements. Have fun, thieves!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-05T11:20:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155579742","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4452620-1831432155571771","game_id":"steam-4452620","kind":"announcement","title":"Thieves and Gold - Demo Available Now!","summary":"In this early demo you can:- Play through four handcrafted rooms- Chase more Skill Tree unlocks as you keep playing- Get a feel for the loot flow, timer pressure, and progression- Help shape the game with your feedbackThis is still an early build, so you may run into rough edges, bugs, and balance that will keep evolving. More rooms, more replay variety, and sharper progression are on the way. You can expect around 1 hour of gameplay! If you enjoy the demo, please wishlist Thieves & Gold on Stea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T15:56:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155571771","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4452620-1828441623112309","game_id":"steam-4452620","kind":"announcement","title":"Thieves and Gold Steam Page Is Now Live","summary":"After many months of work, the Steam page for Thieves and Gold is now live.Thieves and Gold is a medieval loot-heist incremental where you smash containers, grab gold, uncover hidden keys, and recruit a crew of thieves to grow stronger between runs.Race the clock in Heist Mode or play more relaxed in Casual Mode while upgrading your tools, building your crew, and pushing your luck for bigger scores.I’m excited to finally share the game with you, and this is just the beginning. If it looks like y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T14:07:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623112309","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4452620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4452620":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4452620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z"},"4599190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:17Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4452620","app_id":4452620,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_